      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "## Overview\n\n**Period:** 2026-07-02 – 2026-08-01 | **Active Repositories:** 39 of 100 public repos\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Highlights\n\n### New Project: `ol` (Open License Checker)\n- **Launched** — first release [v0.1.0](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/releases/tag/v0.1.0) on 2026-07-28\n- 6 PRs merged in 3 days: generalized dependency scanning, license policy checks, JVM/Maven support, SARIF dependency path, dev library license handling, root exclusion fix\n- PRs: [#1](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/1) [#2](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/2) [#3](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/3) [#4](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/4) [#5](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/5) [#6](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/6) [#7](https://github.com/guitarrapc/ol/pull/7)\n\n### `seiton` — 5 Releases (v1.7.0–v1.7.4)\n- **v1.7.0–v1.7.4** released July 21–23 — fixed Playground freeze while typing incomplete YAML, then refined with two follow-up hotfixes\n- Resolved [#191](https://github.com/guitarrapc/seiton/issues/191) Xcode 27 runner image support\n- PRs: [#195](https://github.com/guitarrapc/seiton/pull/195) [#196](https://github.com/guitarrapc/seiton/pull/196) [#197](https://github.com/guitarrapc/seiton/pull/197)\n\n### `SkiaSharp.QrCode` — Major Version Milestone\n- Released [v1.0.0](https://github.com/guitarrapc/SkiaSharp.QrCode/releases/tag/1.0.0), [v1.0.1](https://github.com/guitarrapc/SkiaSharp.QrCode/releases/tag/1.0.1), [v1.1.0](https://github.com/guitarrapc/SkiaSharp.QrCode/releases/tag/1.1.0) all within July\n- ⭐ 237 stars — most starred active repo this period\n\n### `SortAlgorithms` — Algorithm Additions\n- Added [Driftsort](https://github.com/guitarrapc/SortAlgorithms/pull/20) and [ipnsort](https://github.com/guitarrapc/SortAlgorithms/pull/21)\n\n### `setup-ol` — New GitHub Action\n- Action to install `ol` published; [first PR](https://github.com/guitarrapc/setup-ol/pull/1) merged\n\n---\n\n## 📊 Activity Summary\n\n| Category | Count |\n|---|---|\n| Active repos (past 30 days) | 39 |\n| PRs created | 50+ |\n| PRs merged | ~46 |\n| Open PRs | 4 |\n| Issues created | 1 (+ 2 filtered by policy) |\n| Releases | 9+ |\n\n### Dependency Updates (Dependabot/Renovate)\nHeavy automated dependency maintenance across the ecosystem:\n- `actions/setup-node` 6→7, `actions/setup-go` 6→7, `actions/setup-dotnet` 5→6\n- Security fix: `postcss` bump in `hatenablog-theme-codefocus`\n- `grpc` bump in `envoy-lab`\n\n---\n\n## ⏳ Open PRs (Needs Attention)\n\n| Repo | PR | Title |\n|---|---|---|\n| CopyTabLink | [#6](https://github.com/guitarrapc/CopyTabLink/pull/6) | chore(deps-dev): bump 7 dev dependencies |\n| CopyTabLink | [#7](https://github.com/guitarrapc/CopyTabLink/pull/7) | chore(deps): bump actions/setup-node 6→7 |\n| scoop-bucket | [#28](https://github.com/guitarrapc/scoop-bucket/pull/28) | chore(deps): bump ScoopInstaller/GithubActions |\n| setup-seiton | [#12](https://github.com/guitarrapc/setup-seiton/pull/12) | chore(deps): bump actions/setup-node 6→7 |\n\n---\n\n## 🐛 Open Issues (Backlog Health)\n\n| Repo | Open Issues | Notes |\n|---|---|---|\n| csharp-lab | 8 | Highest open issue count — review for stale items |\n| blog | 4 | Content/site issues pending |\n| envoy-lab | 3 | Lab-related issues |\n| scoop-bucket | 2 | Bucket maintenance needed |\n| hatenablog-theme-codefocus | 1 | |\n| githubactions-lab | 2 | |\n| UnityBuildRunner | 1 | ⭐ 26 stars — user-facing, check priority |\n| PowerShellUtil | 1 | ⭐ 153 stars — user-facing, check priority |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ Suspicious / Notable Activity\n\n- **`csharp-lab` automated PR** ([#444](https://github.com/guitarrapc/csharp-lab/pull/444)): Titled `[automated] GitHub IP automated update` — verify this automation is expected and the PR source is trusted.\n- **`SkiaSharp.QrCode` issues #337 and #354**: Filtered by integrity policy (cannot be read in this workflow). Manual review recommended given the project's 237 stars and active user base.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Actionable Next Steps\n\n1. **Merge open PRs** in `CopyTabLink` (#6, #7), `scoop-bucket` (#28), `setup-seiton` (#12)\n2. **Review `csharp-lab`** — 8 open issues, triage and close stale items\n3. **Verify** the `[automated] GitHub IP automated update` PR source in `csharp-lab`\n4. **Manually review** `SkiaSharp.QrCode` issues #337 and #354 (blocked from automated access)\n5. **Check** `PowerShellUtil` and `UnityBuildRunner` open issues — high-star user-facing repos\n6. **Consider tagging** `ol` v0.1.0 as beta until broader ecosystem support is confirmed\n\n---\n\n*Generated automatically by GitHub Copilot CLI on 2026-08-01. Covers 2026-07-02 to 2026-08-01.*\n\n\n\n\n> Generated by [Monthly OSS Repo Status Report](https://github.com/guitarrapc/githubactions-lab/actions/runs/30677751610) · sonnet46 · 27.7 AIC · ⌖ 5.5 AIC · ⊞ 5K · [◷](https://github.com/search?q=repo%3Aguitarrapc%2Fgithubactions-lab+is%3Aissue+%22gh-aw-workflow-call-id%3A+guitarrapc%2Fgithubactions-lab%2Fmonthly-oss-repo-status%22&type=issues)\n> - [x] expires <!-- gh-aw-expires: 2026-08-08T01:27:04.870Z --> on Aug 8, 2026, 1:27 AM UTC\n\n<!-- gh-aw-agentic-workflow: Monthly OSS Repo Status Report, engine: copilot, version: 1.0.75, model: claude-sonnet-4.6, id: 30677751610, workflow_id: monthly-oss-repo-status, run: https://github.com/guitarrapc/githubactions-lab/actions/runs/30677751610 -->\n\n<!-- gh-aw-workflow-id: monthly-oss-repo-status -->\n<!-- gh-aw-workflow-call-id: guitarrapc/githubactions-lab/monthly-oss-repo-status -->",
